New Character Class

The Pimp Class which is males only and open to Humans and Elves. It's a 
modified monk class without eating restrictions. They tend to be neutral 
or chaotic.

Robes are renamed to smoking jackets. Armor is disdained like monks 
because you can't get in the good dancing moves.

The pimp pantheon is made up of:

Lawful: Casanova
Neutral: Don Juan
Chaotic: Marquis de Sade

Pimps can get up to Grand Master in martial arts because everyone was 
kung-fu fighting. Expert in quarterstaff because every pimp has a cane. 
Expert in dagger because you get on their bad side they'll cut you. 
Skilled in Healing spells and Basic in Divination and Escape spells.

Pimps can wear up to three amulets at one time if they're already wearing 
a Hawaiian shirt. I guess it'd be renamed to an open necked shirt. They 
gain the intrinsics of hallucination resistance (level 1), shock 
resistance (level 3), poison resistance (level 7) and speed (level 11). 
The former three are gained from illicit substances. The latter is from 
being able to move and groove.

Starting out pimps tend to have better than average charisma, agility and 
intelligence. Strength and constitution are lower than average.

Pimps are always successful with succubi in that they never encounter a 
headachy succubus. Of course the succubi still need their rest period. 
Nurses won't hurt a pimp who's still clothed. All generated djinni are 
female and act like Jeannie from I Dream of Jeannie. Okay I'm getting 
silly.

